 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o3ivMA-cYJ0Q7kNvwGylUlb&_nc_oc=AdoNgD7IyUR6jvM1qnMxAu0hs8T4HNvElFJ4ViZemnIdIn9p7eVV_v0LwUNGLm_zBg0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIV-xJjpbtWe3JFnO_Rb3UBe2cTl1qWVx7wAyEI3LR9hw&oe=6AB3EDC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JfoDmKLT544Q7kNvwFQIF8d&_nc_oc=Adrnub6apG7o_UAWBG-IfNM8qq24sL1z5dhdul9-2KRMeBlkS0jzmJDLKmHDgf8voKw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLkxtC-K5LV9bw0KObXwGRCAVPHyqDT3Z-qk0SLL_QjbQ&oe=6AB3C2E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=juta6uZRlGoQ7kNvwHNtxXH&_nc_oc=AdoLwo8gmSVcrvJfuXd92xlHFPnlsDYcjN-UTQClP7mq888vq9jDDqpxXOExggUtwC0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJim1Uy7r8skO7cEDLNmBafT8G-pQurR-tkmAnjXwBNuA&oe=6AB3CCDC"}, {"fil